{"parse": {"title": "9TH-14", "pageid": 97019, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-13\" title=\"9TH-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">9TH-14</span><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-15\" title=\"9TH-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">9TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">14</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.95.9C.E5.AD.90.E4.B8.8E.E9.9D.A2.E5.85.B7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"镜子与面具\">镜子与面具</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 镜子与面具</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Mask in the Mirror</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>两<span class=\"color-value\"></span>面<span class=\"color-value\"></span>镜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>间<span class=\"color-value\"></span>悬<span class=\"color-value\"></span>着<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>物<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>副<span class=\"color-value\"></span>面<span class=\"color-value\"></span>孔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>两<span class=\"color-value\"></span>副<span class=\"color-value\"></span>面<span class=\"color-value\"></span>孔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>穷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尽<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>面<span class=\"color-value\"></span>孔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>&amp;<span class=\"color-value\"></span>n<span class=\"color-value\"></span>b<span class=\"color-value\"></span>s<span class=\"color-value\"></span>p<span class=\"color-value\"></span>;<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10914</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_shoushushi1\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_shoushushi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>狱医先生呢？不对……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>先生，您究竟是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有人留意到面前的陌生囚徒是何时出现在那儿的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他平静、普通得如同一面亘古不变的镜子，仿佛一开始就存在，存在于这个房间、这个迷宫之中，存在于所有人的身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>近在眼前的答案让她仓惶地后退了一步。仿佛事到如今，这个名字所代表的含义，与接下来会发生的事情，让她本能地感到害怕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她最终仍然喊出了那个名字。它沉重，冰冷，让人无所适从。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>阿莱夫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>是你，我的笔友……阿莱夫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>你果然在这里，在科马拉监狱之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>那些回信，那些措辞，那些字符的组合，它们并不是我的想象，也不是神圣的恶作剧……维尔汀，十四行诗！一切就和我先前告诉你们的一样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>它们果然都是有意义的，是真实的存在。嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只是为何，她并没有感到一丝的欣喜？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>先生，所以您就是阿莱夫，监狱的控制者？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>就是您用骰子控制了监狱，并隐匿了德洛丝女士的行踪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>新奇的提问。有别于之前的两千六百六十六个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>诸位科马拉的访客，你们可以叫我阿莱夫，也可以叫我任何名字，无论是敬神的符号，还是可笑的代称。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>我只是一位自愿居住于此的囚徒。组成科马拉万千字符中的一个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>一个字符……阿莱夫先生，您的说法与措辞，都显然与狱医先生相别甚远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但我仍然有些费解，您和狱医究竟是什么关系？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在昏暗的灯光下，面前的男子看起来疲惫不堪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我有一个斗胆的猜测：您就是狱医，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>这是一个不完全正确的说法。但你可以如此认为。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>梅林，他是我脑海中诞生的一个幻影，一个不完整的重演……他是我，但也并不完全是我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>他……他们只是在自己的命题中求索的失败者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>我旁观着这一切，看着他们在注定的命运中挣扎，最后理所当然地溃败，而没有去阻止。这就是我们的关系——仅此而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他们……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>你们已经见过梅林与理想家了，也亲眼目睹了他们的死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>理想家被困于诗句的梦魇，最终甚至失去了自己的名字。<br />而梅林，不过也是被困于科马拉的建筑结构之中罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>沉湎于美妙的希望中无可自拔，孤注一掷。他们的行为确实给诸位带来了一定的麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>如今，他们以自身的溃败作为这场短暂邂逅的落幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……我想我大概明白了。所以理想家先生与狱医，都是您的一部分，或者说，您的人格之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看来，狱卒小姐所说的“监狱中都是精神病人”，并非一句虚言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>狱医先前提到了重塑之手——科马拉监狱中的一切，以及狱医，又和重塑之手有什么关系？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>基金会的访客们，我们都经历过那些消逝的年代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>1977年，第四次暴雨来临前，我来到了乌斯怀亚。他们找到了我——国家福柯学会的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>同时到来的，还有一个自称重塑之手的神秘学家组织。他们都想让我回答他们的问题，把我称为“顾问”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>重塑之手的“顾问”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>他们分别给了我一个概念，以及一个寓言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>概念，以及寓言……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>国家福柯学会想要在这里探求全景监狱概念的可行性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>而重塑之手，则向我展示了，那一则关于过去和未来的寓言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>我日夜不停地寻找答案，在无尽的文字与现实中逡巡——于是梅林基于此诞生了。这是一种尝试，也是一种代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>很抱歉，全新的方向，总是会使我陷入人类摄取知识的局限性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>梅林终其一生，只想通过探索福柯理论的方式，来获取那个唯一的、无限的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>可是，阿莱夫先生，您仍然没有说清楚您帮助重塑之手的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>……理由？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>他们发问了，就像你们一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>而我只是在为他们的问题寻找答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……阿莱夫先生，您的意思是，在您眼中，我们和重塑之手并没有不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>如果我们发问，您也会如实地回答这一切吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>这不正是我们正在经历的事情吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿莱夫拾起了那枚掉落在地上的骰子。它闪烁着抚慰人心的微弱辉光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>这就是他们交给梅林的玩具。一个名叫&lt;glitch&gt;科马拉之雨&lt;/glitch&gt;的巫术骰子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>二十世纪初的探险家们，在无人踏足的南极大陆挖掘出这块属于神祗的魔法石头。它来自一道古远的门扉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>他们惊讶地发现，这块石头能够忠实地映射出人们内心的渴望，将幻影的断壁残垣变成现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>它被雕琢成代表命运的骰子模样。他们曾用它搭建起一所流放神秘学家的疗养院，最后这所疗养院，又被改造成了如今的监狱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的话语并不迂回，却依旧让经历了这一切的外来者们感到困惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>阿莱夫……所以，科马拉的幕后主使，真的是你吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一直沉默的女孩握紧了手中的笔记本。她的指节正因用力而泛白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一本尚未出版的小说雏形。那里留存着只有她本人所知晓的——属于每日伏案，属于自我审视，属于逐字逐句地质疑、推敲、考究的岁月。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一段属于作家的人生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>你说，梅林他想要用全景监狱去追求属于自己的答案，可是这和我的小说有什么关系？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我不能理解……阿莱夫，你为什么要用我的小说来操纵监狱中的一切？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>这里的人们，罗贝托、加西亚、奥克塔维奥、巴勃鲁，还有狱卒小姐……他们都因此而沦陷于一场注定结局的命运之环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>他们被迫成为了阿马尔菲塔诺小镇中的幽灵，被困于这座环形的废墟……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>……你究竟想要做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闻言，孤寂的囚徒只是不解地把玩着手中的骰子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>但这是你自己提出的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>第一封信件的第三行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>你说，你想要给《理性家族的崛起与衰落》这篇小说一个结局。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "9TH-14"}}